{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_11_beg","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":22,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_10_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-11","storyName":"长生劫","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"现实与梦境的边界，重岳与望遥遥相对。岁兽惊怒。望举起直刀，宣告岁的演化已达终点。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_11_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_11","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":20,"next":22,"characters":["岁","望","重岳"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandstone","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_bg_70_g8_suilingcoreruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"50","randomness":"30","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act40side/m_bat_wang.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":9,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#11$1","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"......背逆。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"你们之中的每一个，都打算背逆我到底，是吗？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......没错。我们每一个，都不会束手就擒，变成你的一部分。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我们作为自己活过，这就是我们有别于你的根源。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#11$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"作为......人？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#4$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"你们一个个以人自居，还试图以种种妄念来挑战我。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"你们凭靠假借于我的力量，在渺小的族群中赢得一席之地，却又要卑微地隐藏起自己的爪锋与獠牙，装出一副无害的模样。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"这样就是你所谓的，作为人而活着？！","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你还是不懂......你不会懂，只因你从未活过。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"而我同样清楚......你的傲慢从何而来。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你可以一眼望穿自太古至终末的所有时间，哪怕你的神识已经在太虚中遨游千万载，你也从未有过一个可以对谈的同族。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#10$1","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你只是在这一片可悲的虚无中，将自己当作了至高无上的神明。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":31},{"type":"text","text":"我再清楚不过，那究竟是什么样的感觉。","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"直到有一人，为我起了一个名字。","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"可你从来不是谁的命运......无论是这片大地上的人，还是我们。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你更不会懂，对于一个已经一无所有的人而言......","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#4$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......命运本身，何其无力。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#11$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"好......既然你胆敢重复无谋的挑战，那我同样不介意再摧毁一次你的妄想。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#12$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"一百二十年前我杀死过你，再杀死你一次，不过易如反掌！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"难道你以为我会怕？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......我已经输惯了。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#11$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"......？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我已经输掉了太多宝贵的东西，满盘皆输。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"尊严，荣誉，信任，自由，自我。","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"还有，至亲之人。","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你觉得一个输无可输的人，真的会害怕什么吗？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#3$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"那么，你呢？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你是否还会害怕，再遭受一次如同千年前一样惨痛的失败......","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你又是否会因为害怕，迟疑不前？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#4$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"......笑话！","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"你不过是妄想要取代我，占据这副身躯——我又岂会让你如愿！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#12$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"既然如此，我只要让这副躯体先一步醒来——","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_bg_70_g8_suilingcoreruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","id":66},{"type":"bg","duration":"2","from":"0","to":"1","id":67},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"55","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":68},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"2","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonsterroar","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"巨兽伸出那如同山岳般庞大的利爪。","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"无数个巨兽在无数个岁陵中，向同一个代理人伸出无数个如同山岳的利爪。","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"哪怕这里仍是梦境，只要在所有的梦境之中都抹除这张令人生厌的脸，祂的苏醒就再无任何阻碍。","id":74},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","channel":"2","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchairwall","id":79},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":80,"name":"act49side_02","style":"animekv","slot":"bgover","scalex":"1.1","scaley":"1.1","entryfrom":"0","entryto":"0.3","duration":"0.3","block":"true"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":81},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"50","randomness":"30","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":82},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":83,"name":"act49side_02","style":"animekv","slot":"bgover","scalex":"1.1","scaley":"1.1","entryfrom":"0.3","entryto":"1","duration":"3","block":"true"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"——！","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"怎么回事......","id":85},{"type":"text","text":"一记重击，蕴含着凶暴无匹的力量切实落在祂的躯体上，这样的力量竟然让祂感觉到熟悉。","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"祂意识到自己，在这一瞬间失去了与那庞大躯体的连接。","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"究竟是谁，还能对这副身躯造成如此的伤害？！","id":88},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":89},{"type":"dialog","id":90},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":93},{"type":"curtain","direction":"7","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"1","fadetime":"0","id":94},{"type":"curtain","direction":"3","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"1","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_70_i14.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","x":"200","y":"-100","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"blocker","afrom":"1","rfrom":"0","gfrom":"0","bfrom":"0","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","id":98},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tearspace","delay":"1","id":99},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"50","randomness":"30","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":100},{"type":"curtain","direction":"7","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0.35","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":101},{"type":"curtain","direction":"3","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0.5","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"空间先是震动，而后扭曲、撕裂......","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"如同被积蓄了千百年的武之一字，硬生生撕裂开来的梦的边界。","id":104},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":106},{"type":"curtain","id":107},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_70_i14.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":108},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"30","xTo":"0","yTo":"0","block":"false","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":110},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"怎么会是你——","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......多事！","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"知道你会这么说。","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"我也答应过，如若真的到了这一步，我会同你一起。","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"更何况，我也想带她见你一面，让你知道，你这些年的筹谋......毕竟没有白费。","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"隔着梦境与现实的界限，望先是看见重岳怀中的造物......","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"而后，两人目光相接。","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你该离开了......","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"......","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"活下去。","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"......活着回来。","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我不会向你保证什么。","id":124},{"type":"text","text":"二人的距离迅速拉远。","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"即便是千百岁的武学宗师，人身毕竟仍是人身。","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"穿透现实与梦境的力量迅速消散，但望的耳边仍然响起他熟悉到厌烦的那个人的声音。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":129},{"type":"charslot","id":130},{"type":"image","id":131},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_bg_70_g8_suilingcoreruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"那我会去找你。一直找下去。","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......随你的便。","id":134},{"type":"dialog","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#11$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"是他......他究竟做了什么？！","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#4$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"但是无妨，无妨！无论他做了什么，都不过只有一瞬......一瞬！！","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"50","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":145},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonsterroar_long","volume":"1","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#12$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"他已经不会再来打扰我们了，你那些所有的，可笑的，渺小的......兄弟姐妹，都不会再来打扰我们了！","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"这里是我的梦境，这里此刻只有你和我！","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"我原以为应当把最多的力量用来对付你，可现在看来，你仍旧虚弱，仍旧不堪一击，你只剩最后一把棋子......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"要消灭你......易如反掌！","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#4$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"而那些诗、律、武......那些烦人的蝼蚁，只要动用为你积攒的力量，就可将那些丑陋的干涉，尽数隔绝于外！","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"你配不上我的爪，你只配在你倒影的刀下断气......死亡！","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2129_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"呵......是吗？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"charslot","id":160},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_icecrystlncrse","channel":"2","delay":"0.5","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordtsing8","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":166},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordtsing9","channel":"3","id":167},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":168,"name":"act49side_02","style":"animekv","slot":"bgover","scalex":"1","scaley":"1","entryfrom":"0","entryto":"1","duration":"0.5","block":"true"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","channel":"3","id":171},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"5","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","id":172},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":173,"name":"act49side_01","style":"animekv","slot":"bgover","scalex":"1","scaley":"1","entryfrom":"0","entryto":"0.3","duration":"5","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"可死亡是你的终局，不是我的。","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"对，在所有的因果，所有的可能，所有的幻梦之中，你都会死。","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"梦境中无数次的重复，已经将你最狂暴的那些想象，悉数蛀蚀、掏空，而你浑然不觉。","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你没有发现吗，此时此刻，你用来困住我的梦境，竟都与我，与我们，息息相关？","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你已经囿于自己愤恨的冲动和复仇的枷锁之中......你的演化已然到达终点。","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"而我们，已经超越了你。","id":180},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"但你的身躯终将留存。","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我，会取代你的位置。","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岁","text":"就凭你那些孤立无援的棋子，和行将消散，甚至难以维持形态的身躯？！","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"你又怎敢断言......我只有棋子......和这副身躯？！","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"濒死的代理人用最后的力气举起直刀。","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"癫狂的巨兽发出最后的怒鸣。","id":188},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":190},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hugemonsterroar_long","volume":"1","id":191},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"sticker","id":195,"multi":"true","text":"<i>月斫冷子，日老残枰......</i>","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"sticker","id":196,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n<i>劫灰吹尽送古今。</i>","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0","width":"700","duration":"2","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":197,"duration":"2"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":199},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":200},{"type":"theater","mode":"true","id":201},{"type":"video","res":"video/act49side/TA02.mp4","id":202},{"type":"dialog","id":203},{"type":"theater","mode":"false","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"bgeffect","id":208},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":209},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":210},{"type":"image","id":211},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":212}],"characters":["岁","望","重岳"]}